		<item>
			<title>WPK, a Guiding Party</title>
			<link>http://koreanfriendship.org/dprk-information/16-wpk-a-guiding-party</link>
			<guid isPermaLink="true">http://koreanfriendship.org/dprk-information/16-wpk-a-guiding-party</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<p>The Workers’ Party of Korea (October 10, 1945) founded by President <strong>Kim II Sung</strong> has led the people to victory as a guiding force of the Korean society overcoming all the ordeals and difficulties for the past 71 years.</p>
<p>The WPK, though founded in less than two months after Korea had been liberated (August 15, 1945) from the occupation of Japan(1905-1945), set up next year a people’s power (February, 1946) and relying on it carried out the land reform, nationalization of major industries, sex-equality and other democratic reforms.</p>
<p>And meanwhile it also put great efforts to the building of a regular armed forces and the establishment of an independent munitions industry.</p>
<p>On September 9, 1948 the Democratic People’s Republic of Korea was founded under the leadership of the WPK.</p>
<p>The United States attacked the young DPRK to destroy it enlisting over two million colossal forces including the forces of south Korea, remnants of old Japan and its 15 vassal states in 1950 and continued the war till 1953.</p>
<p>The WPK marshaled all its membership and the army and people and defended the country gloriously and shattered to smithereens the myth of the US “mightiness” in the world.</p>
<p>After the war it roused up all the people to the post-war rehabilitation and construction shattering the sophistry of the imperialists that Korea would not get to its feet in a hundred years, finished the rehabilitation and reconstruction within three years and completed the establishment of the socialist system in 1958 and the socialist industrialization in 1970.</p>
<p>Under the leadership of the WPK Korea put into effect and developed the universal free medical care and universal compulsory free education.</p>
<p>When the US-led imperialist allied forces focused its stifling offensive on Korea, the WPK upheld the banner of Songun to defend the socialist system solidly and put forth a grand plan of building a thriving socialist state and prepared a springboard for bringing it into effect.</p>
<p>In August, 1998, the first satellite was launched completely on its own resources and the land across the country was realigned into sizable standard plots.</p>
<p>The state power of Korea reached an unusually high plane with the development of the up-to-date CNC technique, the launch of the first utility satellites “Kwangmyongsong-3” 2 in December, 2012 and the earth observation “Kwangmyongsong-4” in February, 2016.</p>
<p>Under the leadership of the WPK Korea made self-defensive nuclear deterrence and is strengthening it to cope up with the continued US threat of nuclear pre-emptive attack and rackets of nuclear war games.</p>
<p> The proof of it is the three times of underground nuclear tests and the full success of the first H-bomb test on January 6, 2016.</p>
<p>The Workers’ Party of Korea, which turned Korea into a politically and ideologically powerful nation, an unrivalled military strong nation, a legitimate nuclear state possessed of an H-bomb and a state of manufacturing and launching artificial satellites, is now putting spurs to the building of an economic strong nation and socialist civilized nation.</p>]]></description>
